{"_id":"5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT","img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/shared/shadow.webp","items":[{"_id":"x47iDfIE9albveGl","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Shadow Hand","sort":100000,"system":{"attack":{"value":""},"attackEffects":{"custom":"","value":[]},"bonus":{"value":15},"damageRolls":{"0":{"damage":"2d6+3","damageType":"void"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["finesse","magical"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT.x47iDfIE9albveGl"},{"_id":"ACHlnYzXVxizzqPw","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Light Vulnerability","sort":200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>Attacks against the shadow are treated as magical if made by a creature who is in magical light or with an object that is in magical light (such as from the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4]{Light} spell).</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT.ACHlnYzXVxizzqPw"},{"_id":"YzglqmBZyUccF3kd","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"void-healing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT.YzglqmBZyUccF3kd"},{"_id":"0Qt9ULbGzJV8ZG3W","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Shadow Spawn","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>When a creature's shadow is pulled free by Steal Shadow, it becomes a shadow spawn under the command of the shadow that created it. This @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.clzHAfegb9Rn6DOe]{Shadow Spawn} doesn't have Steal Shadow and is perpetually and incurably @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}.</p>\n<p>If the creature the shadow spawn was pulled from dies, the shadow spawn becomes a full-fledged, autonomous shadow. If the creature recovers from its enfeeblement, its shadow returns to it and the shadow spawn is extinguished.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT.0Qt9ULbGzJV8ZG3W"},{"_id":"0QWVJ7Of8cQNKp0N","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Slink in Shadows","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The shadow can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hide} or end its @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.VMozDqMMuK5kpoX4]{Sneak} in a creature's or object's shadow.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT.0QWVJ7Of8cQNKp0N"},{"_id":"Kjifw1jgDvfmrEGU","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Steal Shadow","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The shadow hit a living creature with a shadow hand Strike on its previous action</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The shadow pulls at the target's shadow, making the creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}. This is cumulative with other enfeebled conditions from shadows, to a maximum of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 4}. If this increases a creature's enfeebled value to 3 or more, the target's shadow is separated from its body (see shadow spawn). The enfeebled value from Steal Shadow decreases by 1 every hour.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["divine"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT.Kjifw1jgDvfmrEGU"}],"name":"Shadow","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":0},"dex":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":-2},"str":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":2}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":20},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"void healing","max":40,"temp":0,"value":40},"immunities":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"death-effects"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"disease"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"paralyzed"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"poison"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"precision"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"unconscious"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"bleed"}],"resistances":[{"doubleVs":["non-magical"],"exceptions":["force","ghost-touch","vitality","spirit"],"type":"all-damage","value":5}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":30}],"value":0}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["necril"]},"level":{"value":4},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>The mysterious undead known as shadows lurk in dark places and feed on those who stray too far from the light.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":10,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":8},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":14},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":12}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":10},"stealth":{"base":14}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["incorporeal","undead","unholy"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.VotlWUsFKdOrHWF6"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!5kXHBVAXzpJd0UIT","folder":null,"prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/shared/shadow.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"shared__pathfinder_monster_core__shadow","sourcePack":"pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core","sourceDocId":"VotlWUsFKdOrHWF6"}}}